Z||000000||Rick 88||09-25-2001||04:50 PM||||I saw a V6 Fiero this weekend with a PRM intake system. It consisted of an intake tube, inline filter housing with K&N filter and nice yellow silicon tubing connectors. The owner said it came out of Canada. He gave me the website. <A HREF="http://www.prmracing.com" TARGET=_blank>www.prmracing.com</A>   He said it was specially made for the Fiero. Anyone have one of these systems, or more info on it.<P>Rick<BR>yellow 88 GT 5-speed||||reg||5
Z||000001||Jay||09-25-2001||04:54 PM||||I've seen them up close and yes they are nicely made (and specifically made for the Fiero).  I don't know if they sell over the net but Race-Tech sells them in Toronto.  They can be reached at 416-747-5728<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
