Z||000009||chester||09-26-2001||04:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Rick 88:<BR><B>Chester,<P>Do you have a pic of the intake showing the inline filter? Does it attach to the factory air intake? How much did the system cost?<P>Thanks,<BR>Rick 88</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I have one at home. I'll post it when I get off from work  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> To install the intake you remove the air box and the original filter housing and hook this up directly to the rubber grommet under the side grill.  Not hard to do.  I think the cost was around 200.<P>Rob D.<P>||||reg||1
